      "explanation": "The string is apple + pen + apple. The word apple is used twice, which is allowed."
    },
    {
      "test_number": 1,
      "explanation": "cats + and leaves og, and cat + sand also leaves og. No dictionary word matches og, so the string cannot be built."
    }
  ],
